      <div class="card-icon" style="background:#EFF6FF;">⚙️</div>
      <div class="card-title">For the Palantir Team</div>
      <div class="card-body">Palantir Foundry as the ontology and data integration layer over MCTFS (authoritative, read-only). AIP as the workflow and decision-support engine. Five integrated domains sharing one data model. A greenfield opportunity to build the DoD's most operationally consequential HR platform on proven Palantir architecture.</div>
    </div>''',
