      <div class="app-desc">MPWG, MPB, MPEB, Three Legged Stool, and 3-Star Forum data products auto-generated on schedule from live D5 data. Standardized slide packages with current inventory, GAR tracking, and retention actuals. MPEB prep time reduced from weeks to hours.</div>
      <div class="app-users"><span class="au-tag">MPP-11</span><span class="au-tag">Directors</span><span class="au-tag">DC M&amp;RA</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>''',
    '''    <div class="app-card">
      <div class="app-num">APP 12</div>
      <div class="app-name">Battle Rhythm Package Generator</div>
      <div class="app-desc">MPWG, MPB, MPEB, Three Legged Stool, and 3-Star Forum data products auto-generated on schedule from live D5 data. Standardized slide packages with current inventory, GAR tracking, and retention actuals. MPEB prep time reduced from weeks to hours.</div>
      <div class="app-users"><span class="au-tag">MPP-11</span><span class="au-tag">Directors</span><span class="au-tag">DC M&amp;RA</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="app-card">
      <div class="app-num">APP 13</div>
      <div class="app-name">Structured Communication Log</div>
      <div class="app-desc">A persistent, role-scoped interaction layer for career communications. Marines log notes visible to their monitor and career counselor. Counselors document counseling session outcomes and follow-up actions. Monitors log contact history. Not a replacement for ETMS or official email — a structured complement that ensures career conversations survive personnel rotations.</div>
      <div class="app-users"><span class="au-tag">Marines</span><span class="au-tag">Career Counselors</span><span class="au-tag">Monitors</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="app-card">
      <div class="app-num">APP 14</div>
      <div class="app-name">Policy Intelligence Engine</div>
      <div class="app-desc">DoD directives, SecNavInsts, MCOs, MARADMINs, and Bulletins semantically indexed and surfaced at the point of decision. Natural language search across the full policy corpus. Policy changes trigger automated alerts for affected workflows and populations. Replaces the Notepad-format MARADMIN bulletin board.</div>
      <div class="app-users"><span class="au-tag">All M&amp;RA</span><span class="au-tag">Monitors</span><span class="au-tag">Unit S-1s</span><span class="au-tag">Marines</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>''', 'add apps 13 and 14')

# ===== 15. GUIDING PRINCIPLES — UPDATE EARS OPEN =====
rep('"Ears open." The 41-person survey that grounded this concept is the beginning, not the end. TITAN development incorporates monitor, Marine, and commander feedback at every phase gate. No feature ships without field validation.',
    'Ears open. The organizational assessment that grounded this concept is the beginning, not the end. TITAN development incorporates monitor, Marine, and commander feedback at every phase gate — structured into the six-month pilot cadence. No feature ships without field validation.', 'ears open principle')

rep('"Enabled by tools." TITAN is the institutional embodiment of this principle. Data analytics and advanced tools in the hands of commanders, monitors, and Marines — not just analysts with special access and long SAAR timelines.',
    'Enabled by tools — not gatekept by them. Analytics and decision support in the hands of commanders, monitors, Marines, and ORSAs — not just analysts behind SAAR queues. The platform expands who can ask the right question.', 'enabled by tools principle')

rep('"It\'s all about performance in combat." Every ranking factor, every data field, every decision support tool is evaluated against whether it improves the Marine Corps\' ability to generate combat-ready forces. Efficiency gains that don\'t serve readiness are secondary.',
    'Performance in combat, first. Every ranking factor, every data field, every decision support tool is evaluated against whether it improves the Marine Corps\' ability to generate combat-ready forces. Efficiency gains that don\'t serve readiness are secondary.', 'principle 1')

rep('"The big idea — align aptitudes to warfighting requirements." The assignment engine ranks Marines against billet requirements, not seniority or submission timestamps. TITAN makes merit-based assignment operationally feasible, not just theoretically desirable.',
    'Align aptitudes to warfighting requirements. The assignment engine ranks Marines against billet requirements, not seniority or submission timestamps. TITAN makes merit-based assignment operationally feasible, not just theoretically desirable.', 'principle 2')

rep('"Maximize transparency." Marines see their own profile, available billets, package status, and career trajectory. This is not a feature — it is a CMC mandate. The Marine Career Portal exists because this principle requires it.',
    'Maximize transparency. Marines see their own profile, available billets, package status, and career trajectory. This is not a feature — it is a CMC mandate. The Marine Career Portal exists because this principle requires it.', 'principle 3')

rep('"Eliminate unnecessary conflict." The assignment engine surfaces family situation flags (EFMP, dependent school age, accompanied/unaccompanied history) so monitors can avoid forcing career-vs-family ultimatums where alternatives exist.',
    'Eliminate unnecessary conflict. The assignment engine surfaces family situation flags so monitors can avoid forcing career-vs-family ultimatums where alternatives exist.', 'principle 4')

